Package: lhsr-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms, dm-mod | linux-image
Description: LHSR RAID kernel module (DKMS)
 Linux Hybrid Self-Healing RAID device-mapper target.
 Provides RAID5/6 with CRC32c scrubbing and read-side self-healing.
 .
 This package contains the dm-lhsr kernel module source for DKMS.
 DKMS will build the module for your running kernel.

Package: lhsrd
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         lsb-base,
         dmsetup,
         smartmontools (>= 7.0)
Recommends: lhsr-dkms
Description: LHSR RAID monitoring daemon and management tools
 Userspace components for LHSR RAID arrays:
   - lhsrd:      Monitoring daemon (SMART, health scores, trend tracking)
   - lhsrctl:    Command-line administration tool
   - lhsr-scan:  Superblock discovery and recovery tool
   - lhsr-*.sh:  Array creation, migration, and boot-time assembly

Package: lhsr
Architecture: all
Depends: lhsr-dkms (= ${binary:Version}),
         lhsrd (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux Hybrid Self-Healing RAID (metapackage)
 Metapackage that installs both the DKMS kernel module and the
 userspace daemon/CLI/recovery tools for LHSR.
